  "question": {
    "text": "Let a function <math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>→</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> defined as&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math><mi>f</mi></math> is"
  },
