  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></math><br /><math><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Range of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math> co-domain</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is surjective<br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is many-one (not&nbsp;injective)</p>"
